#: ../developer/smoke.md:1
msgid "Staging end-to-end smoke"
msgstr "Staging 端到端冒烟测试"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:3
msgid ""
"Use this runbook on a disposable staging deployment to verify the full "
"path from account sign-up to a real pull request. The check covers a "
"Cloud Agent control plane, one runner host, a model provider the tester "
"holds a key for, and a disposable GitHub repository."
msgstr "这份手册用在一套可以随时丢弃的 staging 部署上，验证从账号注册一直到生成真实 pull request 的完整链路。涉及的范围是：一个 Cloud Agent 控制平面、一台 runner 主机、一个测试人员持有密钥的模型服务商，以及一个可以随时丢弃的 GitHub 仓库。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:8
msgid ""
"If you only need a local product check without provider keys, start with "
"the [complete local Docker stack](../../deploy/local/README.md):"
msgstr ""
"如果你只想在本地检查一下产品，不想用服务商的密钥，先用[完整的本地 Docker "
"环境](../../deploy/local/README.md)："

#: ../developer/smoke.md:16
msgid ""
"The local smoke creates the first administrator with the setup code the "
"control plane logs, signs in with the account session, reads "
"administration, and checks that nothing runs before the owner connects a "
"model. It does not test live provider behavior or GitHub publication; "
"this staging runbook checks those boundaries separately."
msgstr "本地 smoke 用控制平面日志中的设置代码创建首个管理员，用账号会话登录，读取管理信息，并检查所有者连接模型之前什么都不会运行。真实服务商的行为和 GitHub 发布它测不到，这两处边界由这份 staging 手册单独检查。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:22
msgid ""
"Earlier runs of this checklist, from the 2026-08 extraction, are kept as "
"a [dated record](../agents/reviews/2026-08-04-staging-smoke-runs.md). "
"They used the retired Gateway sign-in and do not show that any current "
"deployment passes."
msgstr "这份清单在 2026-08 仓库拆分期间跑过的几次结果，保存为一份[带日期的记录](../agents/reviews/2026-08-04-staging-smoke-runs.md)。它们使用的是已退役的 Gateway 登录，并不能说明现在的任何一套部署能通过检查。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:26
msgid "What a passing run proves"
msgstr "跑通一次能证明什么"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:28
msgid ""
"A completed, passing run proves account sign-up and verification, "
"waiting-list approval, administration, a verified model connection, "
"enrollment, sandbox execution on the owner's connection, and GitHub "
"publication for the recorded revision and environment. A successful job "
"alone does not prove publication: the owner asks for it, and the "
"publisher then processes an immutable workspace snapshot asynchronously."
msgstr "完整跑通一次，能证明在所记录的版本和环境下，这些环节都是通的：账号注册和验证、等候名单审批、管理功能、经过验证的模型连接、主机注册、在所有者连接上的沙箱执行，以及 GitHub 发布。光是任务成功，并不能证明发布没问题：发布要由所有者主动发起，之后发布器再异步处理一份不可变的工作区快照。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:35
msgid ""
"The run does not cover concurrency, host loss, or every isolation "
"boundary. Use [deployment reliability](deployment-reliability.md) and "
"[native context recall](context-recall.md) for those separate checks."
msgstr "这次运行不涵盖并发、主机丢失，也没有覆盖每一道隔离边界。这些要分别按[部署可靠性](deployment-reliability.md)和[原生会话的上下文记忆](context-recall.md)去检查。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:39
msgid "0. Before you start"
msgstr "0\\. 开始之前"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:41
msgid ""
"Use a disposable staging deployment with Docker/Compose, a checkout and"
"     enough memory for the selected CLI. The local all-five-CLI smoke "
"recommends     at least 8 GiB; public multi-tenant staging requires a "
"Kata-capable host."
msgstr ""
"用一套可以随时丢弃的 staging 部署，要有 Docker/Compose、一份本地仓库，内存要够所选的 CLI 用。本地跑五个 CLI "
"的冒烟测试建议至少 8 GiB；对公众开放的多租户 staging 需要一台支持 Kata 的主机。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:44
msgid ""
"Record the exact release SHA. API, host, sandbox manager and sandbox must"
"     satisfy the shared deployment/version checks."
msgstr "记下确切的发布 SHA。API、主机、sandbox manager 和沙箱都必须通过共用的部署和版本检查。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:46
msgid ""
"Start from a new, empty Agent database. Run     `python -m "
"cloud_agent.identity_namespace --check` against it first; it     must "
"report an empty database and change nothing     ([cutover](upgrade-"
"notes.md#independent-accounts-cutover))."
msgstr "从一个新的空 Agent 数据库开始。先针对它运行 `python -m cloud_agent.identity_namespace --check`；它必须报告这是空数据库，并且不做任何改动（[切换说明](upgrade-notes.md#independent-accounts-cutover)）。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:50
msgid ""
"Have a mail transport the deployment may use for test addresses you     "
"control (or turn email verification off for the run), and a provider API"
"     key the test account may spend."
msgstr "准备一个部署可以用来给你控制的测试地址发信的邮件传输（或在这次运行中关闭邮箱验证），以及一个测试账号可以消耗的服务商 API 密钥。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:53
msgid ""
"Choose a disposable GitHub repository and configure write/PR permission"
"     through the deployment's supported GitHub App or publishing "
"credential.     Record its base branch. Do not use a repository others "
"depend on."
msgstr ""
"选一个可以随时丢弃的 GitHub 仓库，通过部署支持的 GitHub App 或发布凭据，给它配置写入和创建 PR 的权限。记下它的 base "
"分支。不要用别人在用的仓库。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:57
msgid "1. Configure"
msgstr "1\\. 配置"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:59
msgid ""
"Use separate, private environment files for the control plane and host. "
"Start from [`control-plane/.env.example`](../../deploy/control-"
"plane/.env.example) and "
"[`host/.env.example`](../../deploy/host/.env.example); "
"[ENVIRONMENT.md](../../ENVIRONMENT.md) is the reference."
msgstr "控制平面和主机各用一份独立的私有环境文件。分别从 [`control-plane/.env.example`](../../deploy/control-plane/.env.example) 和 [`host/.env.example`](../../deploy/host/.env.example) 改起，参考资料是 [ENVIRONMENT.md](../../ENVIRONMENT.md)。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:64
msgid ""
"Generate deployment-owned secrets once and keep them out of version "
"control:"
msgstr "部署自己用的 secret 只生成一次，并且不要放进版本控制："

#: ../developer/smoke.md:73
msgid ""
"Keep the encryption keys stable so saved connections and settings remain "
"decryptable. None of them is shared with any other service."
msgstr "加密密钥要保持不变，已保存的连接和设置才能继续解密。它们都不与任何其他服务共用。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:76
msgid ""
"Set `AGENT_WEB_BASE_URL`, `AGENT_PUBLIC_API_URL`, the web base path and"
"     browser API path. Set no `GATEWAY_*`, `IDENTITY_*` or "
"`AGENT_AUTH_MODE`:     the control plane and `deploy.sh` refuse them."
msgstr "设置 `AGENT_WEB_BASE_URL`、`AGENT_PUBLIC_API_URL`、Web base path 和浏览器 API 路径。不要设置任何 `GATEWAY_*`、`IDENTITY_*` 或 `AGENT_AUTH_MODE`：控制平面和 `deploy.sh` 会拒绝它们。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:79
msgid ""
"Set explicit Compose project names, sandbox image, enrolled host name,"
"     sandbox manager credential/reverse route, both tunnel destinations "
"and keys,     and the host's non-overlapping egress pool/resolver."
msgstr "明确设置：Compose 项目名、沙箱镜像、要注册的主机名、sandbox manager 凭据和反向路由、两条隧道各自的目标地址和密钥，以及主机上互不重叠的出口地址池和 DNS 解析器。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:82
msgid ""
"Render configuration privately using the active environment file. Export"
"     `AGENT_DEPLOYMENT_SHA` for direct control-plane Compose commands; "
"the     deployment scripts supply it themselves. Rendered configuration "
"contains     secrets, so do not paste it into acceptance logs."
msgstr ""
"用当前生效的环境文件，在私密的地方渲染出最终配置。如果直接对控制平面执行 Compose 命令，要导出 "
"`AGENT_DEPLOYMENT_SHA`；部署脚本会自己设置它。渲染出来的配置里有 secret，不要贴进验收日志。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:87
msgid "2. Start the control plane"
msgstr "2\\. 启动控制平面"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:89
msgid ""
"Use the deployment process in [deployment reliability](deployment-"
"reliability.md). For a cold source deployment, its `prepare` and "
"`prepare-database` phases build images, start Postgres, check the "
"identity namespace read-only, migrate, and bootstrap the API and MCP "
"listener needed for host readiness. Complete activation after the host "
"publishes readiness in section 4."
msgstr "按[部署可靠性](deployment-reliability.md)里的部署流程操作。如果是从零开始的源码部署，它的 `prepare` 和 `prepare-database` 两个阶段会构建镜像、启动 Postgres、以只读方式检查身份命名空间、执行迁移，再启动主机就绪检查要用到的 API 和 MCP 监听器。等主机在第 4 节报告就绪之后，再完成激活。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:95
msgid ""
"Migrations exit successfully at the checkout's current head. The API does"
"     not create missing tables at startup."
msgstr "迁移在本地仓库当前的 head 上成功退出。API 启动时不会自动创建缺失的表。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:97
msgid "Main API `/healthz` responds on port 8000 by default."
msgstr "主 API 的 `/healthz` 能响应，默认端口 8000。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:98
msgid ""
"MCP-only `/healthz` responds on port 8001 by default; its tunnel targets"
"     that listener."
msgstr "MCP 专用监听器的 `/healthz` 能响应，默认端口 8001；MCP 隧道指向的就是这个监听器。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:100
msgid ""
"The control-plane log has `agent_local_setup_pending` with a one-time"
"     setup code. Do not paste the code into the run log."
msgstr "控制平面日志中有带一次性设置代码的 `agent_local_setup_pending`。不要把这个代码贴进运行记录。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:103
msgid "3. Accounts — setup, sign-up, approval"
msgstr "3\\. 账号：设置、注册、审批"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:105
msgid ""
"Open `/setup/administrator`, exchange the setup code for the first     "
"administrator and sign in. Setup is closed afterwards: a second attempt"
"     answers 409 `setup_complete`."
msgstr "打开 `/setup/administrator`，用设置代码兑换首个管理员并登录。之后设置即关闭：再试一次会得到 409 `setup_complete`。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:108
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`GET /v1/session/me` returns the administrator's `id` and     "
"`agent_access: {allowed, permissions}` with `agent.admin`; there is no"
"     `auth_mode`. The session cookie is `__Host-"
"cloud_agent_local_session`.     Avoid recording cookies or token bodies "
"in the run log."
msgstr "`GET /v1/session/me` 返回管理员的 `id`，以及带 `agent.admin` 的 `agent_access: {allowed, permissions}`；没有 `auth_mode`。会话 cookie 是 `__Host-cloud_agent_local_session`。不要在运行记录里记下 cookie 或令牌内容。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:112
msgid ""
"In a second browser, sign up a test account, follow the verification     "
"link, and apply. It sees the waiting list and cannot create a task."
msgstr "在另一个浏览器中注册一个测试账号，点击验证链接并提交申请。它看到等候名单，不能创建任务。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:114
msgid ""
"As the administrator, approve the application under **Admin →     "
"Accounts**. The test account now holds `agent.use`."
msgstr "以管理员身份在 **管理 → 账号** 下批准该申请。测试账号现在拥有 `agent.use`。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:117
msgid "4. Enrol the host"
msgstr "4\\. 注册主机"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:119
msgid ""
"Issue `POST /admin/agent/runner-hosts/enroll-token` with the chosen "
"`host`     name using infrastructure admin access. The response reveals a"
" single-use     enrollment token; put it in the host's private "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
"用基础设施管理员权限，带上选好的 `host` 名，调用 `POST /admin/agent/runner-hosts/enroll-"
"token`。响应里会给出一个只能用一次的注册令牌，把它放进主机的私有配置。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:122
msgid ""
"Deploy the host through `deploy/host/deploy.sh` for the same target "
"release.     The host process prepares/attests the sandbox image, starts "
"tunnels and     sandbox manager, probes the MCP relay and publishes the "
"completed-generation     marker. Directly starting runner Compose "
"containers does not complete this gate."
msgstr "用 `deploy/host/deploy.sh` 把主机部署到同一个目标版本。主机进程会准备并证明沙箱镜像、启动隧道和 sandbox manager、探测 MCP 中继，最后写入“本代已完成”的标记。直接启动 runner 的 Compose 容器，过不了这一关。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:126
msgid ""
"`GET /admin/agent/runner-hosts` shows a fresh online heartbeat, expected"
"     deployment capability and reachable sandbox manager URL. Check the "
"reverse     sandbox manager route from the control plane."
msgstr "`GET /admin/agent/runner-hosts` 显示：刚收到的在线心跳、预期的部署能力，以及可以访问的 sandbox manager URL。再从控制平面检查一下反向 sandbox manager 路由。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:129
msgid ""
"Complete control-plane activation and confirm its readiness check "
"succeeds     for the intended host/API SHA."
msgstr "完成控制平面的激活，确认它的就绪检查对预期的主机和 API SHA 通过。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:132
msgid "5. One job, all the way"
msgstr "5\\. 跑通一个完整的任务"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:134
msgid ""
"As the test account, add a model connection under **My settings → Model"
"     connections** with the provider's Base URL, the tester's key and a "
"model     id, and choose **Verify and save**. A failed check saves "
"nothing."
msgstr "以测试账号身份，在 **我的设置 → 模型连接** 下用服务商的 Base URL、测试人员的密钥和一个模型 ID 添加模型连接，然后选择 **验证并保存**。检查失败时不保存任何内容。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:137
msgid "Connect/authorize the scratch repository under **Integrations**."
msgstr "在 **Integrations** 里连接并授权这个临时仓库。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:138
msgid ""
"Create a task on its intended base branch with a small verifiable change,"
"     such as adding a `CONTRIBUTING.md` containing a specified sentence."
msgstr "在预定的 base 分支上创建一个任务，改动要小、容易验证，比如新建一个 `CONTRIBUTING.md`，里面写一句指定的话。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:140
msgid ""
"Observe `queued` then a host claim. Record job/attempt/host identifiers."
"     The turn names its model and connection; no reasoning-effort control"
" is     offered for it."
msgstr "观察到 `queued`，然后是主机认领。记下任务、attempt 和主机的标识符。这一轮注明了其模型和连接；不提供推理强度控件。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:143
msgid ""
"Confirm events stream to the browser and at least one model/tool call"
"     succeeds, and that the run's usage footer shows reported tokens and "
"says     the provider bills it."
msgstr "确认事件能实时推送到浏览器，至少有一次模型或工具调用成功，并且运行的用量页脚显示上报的 token 数并注明由服务商计费。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:146
msgid ""
"Confirm the turn succeeds with the expected file change. Nothing is     "
"published until you ask: choose **Create PR** in the conversation, wait"
"     for the publication to finish, and open the real **draft pull "
"request**.     Check target branch, author and diff; record its URL. "
"Execution success     alone is insufficient."
msgstr ""
"确认这一轮成功了，文件改动符合预期。你不发起，就什么都不会发布：在对话里点 **Create PR**，等发布完成，再打开那个真实的 "
"**draft pull request**。检查目标分支、作者和 diff，记下它的 URL。光是执行成功是不够的。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:151
msgid "List files and open a terminal on the retained workspace through the app."
msgstr "在应用里列出保留工作区的文件，并打开一个终端。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:153
msgid "6. The parts that only fail later"
msgstr "6\\. 那些过一阵才会出问题的地方"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:155
msgid ""
"Run failure injection only in the disposable staging deployment and "
"restore its original settings after each case."
msgstr "故障注入只能在可以随时丢弃的 staging 部署上做，每做完一项，都要把设置改回原样。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:158
msgid ""
"**Cancellation:** cancel a separate running turn. Verify worker     "
"acknowledgment and terminal cancellation."
msgstr "**取消**：取消另一轮正在运行的任务。确认 worker 已确认取消，且任务以取消的终态结束。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:160
msgid ""
"**Revocation:** as the administrator, withdraw the test account's access"
"     while a turn runs. Its work stops, its streams end within 15 "
"minutes, and     a new task is refused; restoring access does not restart"
" the old turn."
msgstr "**撤销**：在一轮任务运行时，以管理员身份撤销测试账号的访问权限。它的工作会停止，数据流在 15 分钟内结束，新任务会被拒绝；恢复访问权限不会重新启动旧的那一轮。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:163
msgid ""
"**Fail closed:** stop the database briefly, then attempt fresh sign-in "
"and     a protected owner request. Neither may gain access; `/me` shows a"
"     temporary failure without exposing protected content. Restore it and"
"     verify recovery."
msgstr "**出错时一律拒绝**：短暂停掉数据库，然后尝试全新登录，并发起一个受保护的所有者请求。两者都不能获得访问权；`/me` 显示暂时性失败，且不露出受保护的内容。恢复数据库后，确认一切恢复正常。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:167
msgid ""
"**Control-plane loss:** stop the disposable API while a task runs. After"
"     restoring it, verify lease/reaper handling."
msgstr "**控制平面中断**：在任务运行时，停掉这套可丢弃部署的 API。恢复之后，检查租约和 reaper 的处理是否正确。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:169
msgid ""
"Check live follow-up and same-container idle restore separately using"
"     [context recall](context-recall.md#verification-before-"
"accepting-a-deployment)."
msgstr ""
"按[上下文记忆](context-recall.md#verification-before-"
"accepting-a-deployment)里的方法，分别检查运行中发送后续消息，以及同一个容器在空闲后的恢复。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:172
msgid "7. Tear down"
msgstr "7\\. 收尾清理"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:174
msgid ""
"Stop the disposable stacks using their recorded project names. Keep data"
"     until acceptance evidence has been captured. Volume deletion is "
"permanent;     use `down -v` only for a stack whose database is "
"intentionally disposable."
msgstr "用记下的项目名，停掉这些可丢弃的环境。验收证据收集完之前，数据先留着。删除卷是不可恢复的；只有数据库确实可以丢弃的环境，才用 `down -v`。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:177
msgid ""
"Delete scratch branches/repository and the test account's model     "
"connection, and revoke the test provider key and repository credentials"
"     when the deployment is retired."
msgstr "部署退役时，删掉临时分支或临时仓库以及测试账号的模型连接，并撤销测试用的服务商密钥和仓库凭据。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:180
msgid ""
"Restore any failure-injection settings on staging and record the result"
"     as described under [Log](#log)."
msgstr "把 staging 上所有故障注入的设置都改回去，并按[记录](#log)一节的要求记下结果。"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:183
msgid "Log"
msgstr "记录"

#: ../developer/smoke.md:185
msgid ""
"Record results while running: the date and time (UTC), result and notes "
"for each numbered section, plus the source SHA, environment, host, job "
"and PR identifiers. Keep the record with the deployment's own acceptance "
"evidence."
msgstr ""
"边跑边记：每个编号小节的日期和时间（UTC）、结果和备注，以及源 SHA、环境、主机、任务和 PR "
"的标识。这份记录和部署自己的验收证据放在一起保存。"
